# BouncyCastle 1.81, Spring Boot 4.0.1, Netty 4.2.9) — allowlisted ONLY so the
# build-push -> dispatch -> ArgoCD loop can run end to end. Not a risk acceptance.
# Remove these and bump the dependencies before relying on this pipeline.
